# Settings > Updates (report 047 P1): a PC (amd64) on 0.8.12 when 0.8.13 has only an arm64 bundle: nothing offered
# ("Up to date"), the status line says why. Review only: no golden.
title updates no bundle for this architecture
review
sizes 640x480 480x800
@480x800 profile pda
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30 2026-11-05
wifi 70
bt on
update net on
update build 0.8.12 release amd64
update answer releases-0.8.13-arm64-only.json
home
launch Settings
wait 300
key UP
key UP
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
wait 1000
shot updates_noasset
expect_text "No build for amd64 in 0.8.13"
expect_text "Up to date"
